{"seq":1,"slug":"data-preprocessing","title":"数据预处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/feature-engineering/data-preprocessing","wordCount":991,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据预处理\">数据预处理</h1><h2 id=\"为什么需要数据预处理\">为什么需要数据预处理</h2><p>数据预处理（Data Preprocessing）是机器学习流程中最关键的步骤之一。真实世界的数据通常存在缺失值、异常值、尺度不一致等问题。高质量的预处理直接影响模型的训练效果和泛化能力。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;原始数据&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;缺失值处理&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;异常值处理&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;特征编码&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;标准化/归一化&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;干净数据&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"原始数据\"] --&gt; B[\"缺失值处理\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"异常值处理\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"特征编码\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"标准化/归一化\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"干净数据\"]</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> &quot;垃圾进，垃圾出&quot;（Garbage In, Garbage Out）是机器学习的金科玉律。在模型调优之前，确保数据质量是获得好结果的前提。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>数据预处理围绕四个概念展开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>尺度（Scale）</strong>：不同特征的数值范围差异。模型（尤其是基于距离或梯度的）会误以为数值大的特征更重要，因此需要标准化/归一化。</li>\n<li><strong>编码（Encoding）</strong>：把类别变量转为数值。关键在于<strong>是否引入虚假的序关系</strong>——有序类别用 Label Encoding，无序类别用 One-Hot。</li>\n<li><strong>缺失机制（Missingness）</strong>：缺失是随机的、有规律的还是本身携带信息，决定了用均值填充、模型预测还是标记为新类别。</li>\n<li><strong>数据泄露（Data Leakage）</strong>：在测试集上&quot;偷看&quot;了训练信息。最典型的是在全体数据上 fit scaler——<strong>正确做法是只在训练集 fit，再用同一参数 transform 测试集</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>前三个是&quot;怎么处理数据&quot;，第四个是&quot;必须遵守的纪律&quot;。它贯通所有变换：无论填充、编码还是缩放，拟合参数只能来自训练集。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"归一化与标准化\">归一化与标准化</h2><p>不同特征的数值范围差异巨大（如年龄 0-100 vs 收入 0-1000000），会导致模型训练困难。缩放可以解决这个问题。</p>\n<h3 id=\"标准化-standardization-z-score\">标准化（Standardization / Z-Score）</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mi>σ</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x&#x27; = \\frac{x - \\mu}{\\sigma}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>将数据转换为均值为 0、标准差为 1 的分布。</p>\n<h3 id=\"归一化-min-max-normalization\">归一化（Min-Max Normalization）</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x&#x27; = \\frac{x - x_{min}}{x_{max} - x_{min}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>将数据缩放到 [0, 1] 区间。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>结果分布</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>对异常值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>标准化</td>\n<td>均值 0，标准差 1</td>\n<td>SVM、线性模型、NN</td>\n<td>鲁棒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>归一化</td>\n<td>[0, 1]</td>\n<td>KNN、图像像素</td>\n<td>敏感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RobustScaler</td>\n<td>基于中位数和 IQR</td>\n<td>含异常值数据</td>\n<td>最鲁棒</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import numpy as np&#10;from sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler, MinMaxScaler, RobustScaler&#10;&#10;np.random.seed(42)&#10;X = np.array([&#10;    [25, 50000, 3],&#10;    [30, 65000, 5],&#10;    [35, 80000, 7],&#10;    [45, 120000, 10],&#10;    [60, 300000, 15],&#10;])&#10;&#10;scalers = {&#10;    &quot;StandardScaler&quot;: StandardScaler(),&#10;    &quot;MinMaxScaler&quot;:   MinMaxScaler(),&#10;    &quot;RobustScaler&quot;:   RobustScaler(),&#10;}&#10;&#10;for name, scaler in scalers.items():&#10;    X_scaled = scaler.fit_transform(X)&#10;    print(f&quot;\\n{name}:&quot;)&#10;    print(f&quot;  均值: {X_scaled.mean(axis=0).round(4)}&quot;)&#10;    print(f&quot;  标准差: {X_scaled.std(axis=0).round(4)}&quot;)&#10;    print(f&quot;  范围: [{X_scaled.min(axis=0).round(4)}, {X_scaled.max(axis=0).round(4)}]&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.preprocessing </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> StandardScaler, MinMaxScaler, RobustScaler</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">np.random.seed(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">X </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.array([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [</span><s