tyle=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mean) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> std)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">outliers_z </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data[z_scores </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Z-Score 方法 (|z| > 3):\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"  检测到 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(outliers_z)</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 个异常值: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">outliers_z.round(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>处理方式</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>删除</td>\n<td>移除异常样本</td>\n<td>确认是错误数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>截断</td>\n<td>替换为边界值</td>\n<td>保留样本但限制范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变换</td>\n<td>对数/Box-Cox 变换</td>\n<td>偏态分布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保留</td>\n<td>不处理</td>\n<td>异常值是有价值信息</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 数据预处理的 fit 必须只在训练集上进行，然后用同样的参数 transform 测试集。否则会导致数据泄露（Data Leakage），使评估结果过于乐观。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>标准化</strong>和<strong>归一化</strong>是消除特征尺度差异的基本手段，几乎所有模型都需要。</li>\n<li><strong>特征编码</strong>将类别变量转为数值，One-Hot 适合无序类别，Label Encoding 适合有序类别。</li>\n<li><strong>缺失值</strong>可通过均值、中位数或 KNN 填充处理，选择取决于缺失模式。</li>\n<li><strong>异常值</strong>的检测可用 IQR 或 Z-Score 方法，处理方式需结合业务理解。</li>\n<li>所有预处理操作必须在训练集上 fit，避免数据泄露。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数据预处理","id":"数据预处理"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么需要数据预处理","id":"为什么需要数据预处理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"归一化与标准化","id":"归一化与标准化"},{"level":3,"text":"标准化（Standardization / Z-Score）","id":"标准化-standardization-z-score"},{"level":3,"text":"归一化（Min-Max Normalization）","id":"归一化-min-max-normalization"},{"level":2,"text":"特征编码","id":"特征编码"},{"level":3,"text":"Label Encoding","id":"label-encoding"},{"level":3,"text":"One-Hot Encoding","id":"one-hot-encoding"},{"level":2,"text":"缺失值处理","id":"缺失值处理"},{"level":2,"text":"异常值处理","id":"异常值处理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"超参数调优","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/training-and-optimization/hyperparameter-tuning"},"next":{"title":"特征选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/feature-engineering/feature-selection"}}